message: "If you use these data or scripts, please cite this release and the associated manuscript."
title: "A muroid-specific DNMT3L G9a-contact state among eutherians and conserved DNMT3A contacts across tetrapods: data and code"
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20574054"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ghostneuron/DNMT3L-evolution"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Lu
    given-names: Jie
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6843-9720"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
abstract: >-
  Versioned data, code, figures, and reproducibility records for a comparative
  analysis of vertebrate DNMT3L evolution centered on a sampled muroid LFI
  state at NP105/NP106/NP107, matched partner-side conservation, locus
  evidence, ancestral reconstruction, and alignment sensitivity.
keywords:
  - DNMT3L
  - molecular evolution
  - comparative genomics
  - G9a
  - EHMT2
  - DNA methylation
  - ancestral reconstruction
